invalid type: string "Prompt: What is the difference between simpletable and table in DITA?\n\nAnswer:\n`<simpletable>` is the lightweight table model. `<table>` is the full CALS table model.\n\nUse `<simpletable>` when you only need straightforward rows and columns.\nUse `<table>` when you need spans, column specifications, or more precise publishing behavior.\n\n`<simpletable>` example\n```xml\n